OL,3,GNEWSANew rules causing 'sleepless
OL,4,Anights' for fishers
OL,5,
OL,6,FA Jersey fisherman has said the
OL,7,Fexpansion of marine protected areas is
OL,8,Fthreatening the industry's future, but
OL,9,Fthe approval of five additional bluefin
OL,10,Ftuna licences had offered a much-needed
OL,11,Fboost.
OL,13,FNew rules mean the area of sea
OL,14,Fprotected from trawling and dredging
OL,15,Fhas more than tripled. Conservationists
OL,16,Fsaid the changes would protect
OL,17,Fimportant areas of sea and improve the
OL,18,Flong-term health of fish stocks.
OL,23,APub: 02-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB Ch Is NewsC  Reg TVF Weather
FL,445,440,260,160,0,100
