OL,3,GNEWSANew rules causing 'sleepless
OL,4,Anights' for fishers
OL,5,
OL,6,FFishers have welcomed the extra tuna
OL,7,Flicences, but said the fishery was only
OL,8,Fseasonal and would not make up for the
OL,9,Ffishing areas lost.
OL,11,FEnvironment Minister Mary Le Hegarat
OL,12,Fsaid Jersey's seas were "one of the
OL,13,Fisland's greatest natural assets" and
OL,14,Fneeded continuous protection.
